    {
      "id": "claim_4063cb79728f43ad84f353f173038657",
      "statement": "The WebSocket upgrader's CheckOrigin (sameOriginOrAllowed) accepts requests with no Origin header, any full Origin value in the APP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS allow-list including the * wildcard (ZeroHub is intentionally operated as a public signaling service and this support must not be removed until the official developer portal ships), and Origins whose host equals the request Host case-insensitively; unparseable Origins are rejected. After the upgrade, ws.SetReadLimit(WSMaxFrameSize) caps inbound frames at 1 MiB so an oversized frame gets a 1009 close instead of exhausting memory.",
