    {
      "id": "claim_498f6aafbe3d491abad6788579b06ceb",
      "statement": "Every user-chosen-hub-ID path (CreateStaticHub, CreateHubByID, JoinOrCreateHubByID) holds h.hubIdCrossModeMu across the shared claimHubForCreate/claimGetOrCreateHub helpers, which probe the sibling hub modes' storage and claim the ID under one lock, answering 409 when a sibling already holds the ID; generated IDs (random UUID, IP FNV hash) also take the lock, but their probe always misses so the guard is a no-op there.",
