    {
      "id": "claim_d1a45c77e3f6413b9d1f09550465782b",
      "statement": "Plain-HTTP requests that arrive while the server is migrating (/v1/static-hubs/create, /v1/status) are answered with a 301 whose body carries {status: migrating, backupHost} via migrateHTTPResponse, because ForwardMigrate requires a WebSocket handshake and would surface a 503 to an out-of-band HTTP client; no hub is created while migrating.",
