      "statement": "The routing switch in Handler.Serve includes a /v1/ip-hubs/join case that dispatches JoinHub against the IP ZeroHub instance (zeroHubIP), allowing a client to join an existing IP hub by its server-generated numeric hub id (added alongside the client's joinIPHub entry point).",
